--- !u!114 &1654472176
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1654472173}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9493ccce3d55ff24aa89a1e58a5871c6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectWorldDialogue
  daySets:
  - day: 1
    greetingLine: Great, another rookie. Try not to embarrass yourself in there.
    options:
    - playerLine: Any advice for my first day?
      npcResponse: Yeah. Trust nobody, believe nothing they tell you, and don't puke
        on the paperwork. That's the whole job.
      animationTrigger: TalkDismissing
    - playerLine: You don't think I'll last, do you?
      npcResponse: Kid, I've seen inspectors quit by lunch. You've got that new-boots
        shine on you. Ask me again in a week.
      animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    - playerLine: What's with all the security here?
      npcResponse: Above your pay grade. Just check the papers, stamp the form, and
        keep the line moving. Questions get you nowhere fast.
      animationTrigger: TalkShrug
  - day: 2
    greetingLine: Huh. Didn't think you'd show up again.
    options:
    - playerLine: Rough one yesterday. Any tips for today?
      npcResponse: Tip? Don't trust the calm ones. The nervous ones are usually just
        nervous. It's the ones smiling too much you gotta watch.
      animationTrigger: TalkShrug
    - playerLine: Still think I won't last?
      npcResponse: Ask me again tomorrow. You're still standing, I'll give you that
        much.
      animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    - playerLine: Has anything changed since yesterday?
      npcResponse: More bodies through that door than yesterday, that's for sure.
        Command's getting antsy. Just do your job and don't ask questions you don't
        want answered.
      animationTrigger: TalkDismissing
  suspectData: {fileID: 0}
